OL,3,AFamed ship SS United States sunk off
OL,4,Acoast of Florida
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ship that was once the fastest in the
OL,7,Fworld and is longer than the Titanic
OL,8,Fhas intentionally been sunk off the
OL,9,Fcoast of Florida, turning into the
OL,10,Fworld's largest artificial ocean reef.
OL,12,FThe SS United States spent nearly 30
OL,13,Fyears docked in Philadelphia before it
OL,14,Fwas moved to Florida, where it will
OL,15,Fbecome a home for sealife and an
OL,16,Funderwater attraction for marine
OL,17,Fenthusiasts.
OL,19,FActivists unsuccessfully fought for the
OL,20,Fhistoric liner - which crossed the
OL,21,FAtlantic Ocean hundreds of times - to
OL,22,Fbe preserved as a museum.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
