OL,3,AFamed ship SS United States sunk off
OL,4,Acoast of Florida
OL,5,
OL,6,FInstead, after being purchased by a
OL,7,FFlorida county, it was added to the
OL,8,Fdozens of artificial reefs off the
OL,9,Fcoast, with a land-based museum
OL,10,Fdetailing the ship's history also
OL,11,Fplanned.
